<title>USA: Publix Super Markets 1996 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Publix Super Markets 1996 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAKELAND, Fla. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publix Super Markets Inc said 1996 sales increased 11.1 percent to $10.4 billion, and 1996 net earnings increased 9.5 percent to $265.2 million.</p>
<p>The company said 1996 earnings included an $89 million charge related to the settlement of a gender discrimination lawsuit and an EEOC Commissioner's charge.</p>
<p>The charge reduced net earnings by $46.4 million.</p>
</text>
